    "n_faq_content_gxGnmA": {
      "type": "n_faq-content",
      "blocks": {
        "faq_item_Qkyqtx": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "secure_strap": false,
            "heading": "When can I expect to receive my Qure package?",
            "text": "<p>We are working closely with our external partners and carriers to ensure your Order can reach you as quickly as possible. See below for the most up-to-date information (excluding potential courier delays)*:</p><p>Estimated Shipping Time</p><p><strong>Australia & New Zealand</strong><br/>Standard: 7–14 business days<br/>Express: 1–5 business days</p><p><strong>United States</strong><br/>Standard: 3–6 business days<br/>Express: 2–5 business days</p><p><strong>Canada & Mexico</strong><br/>Standard: 5–10 business days<br/>Express: 2–3 business days</p><p><strong>United Kingdom</strong><br/>Standard: 3–4 business days<br/>Express: 1–2 business days</p><p><strong>Europe</strong><br/>Economy: 6–18 business days<br/>Express: 2–5 business days</p><p><strong>Asia</strong> <em>(selected countries)</em><br/>Economy: 6–18 business days<br/>Express: 2–3 business days</p><p><strong>Middle East</strong> <em>(selected countries)</em><br/>Standard: 6–12 business days<br/>Express: 3–6 business days</p><p><strong>Rest of World</strong><br/>Economy: 6–18 business days<br/>Express: 2–5 business days</p><p>*During the Black Friday and holiday seasons, please be aware that packages may experience delays due to high order volume.</p>",
            "section_id": "Shipping"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_J8LQPm": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "secure_strap": false,
            "heading": "Where does Qure ship to?",
            "text": "<p>Qure currently ships worldwide! Packages are shipped via FedEx, USPS or DHL courier with standard shipping services.</p><p>In Spain we don't ship to Balears Province (also known as the Balearic Islands), Las Palmas, and Santa Cruz de Tenerife.</p><p>Free shipping applies to orders over $149 for US and £149 for UK. See \"How much does shipping cost?\" below.</p>",
            "section_id": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_item_GxG63x": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "secure_strap": false,
            "heading": "How much does shipping cost?",
            "text": "<p>Final shipping charges and available express shipping options are shown at checkout.</p>",
            "section_id": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_item_wiXHBi": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "secure_strap": false,
            "heading": "When will my order ship?",
            "text": "<p>Here's how it works: you order, we process, then we ship. Ordering takes a few seconds.&nbsp;</p><p>Processing takes 1 to 3 business days (and orders placed after 9am ET are processed the next business day). Then one of our carriers takes it from there. Pre-order and backordered items ship on the date shown on the product page.</p><p>You'll get a shipment notification email with a tracking number as soon as your package ships and it's on the way!</p><p>Check your spam folder if you do not see it, and add our sender address to your contacts.</p>",
            "section_id": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_item_NXiPYf": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "secure_strap": false,
            "heading": "Why is my order arriving in more than one package?",
            "text": "<p>If your order includes an item that is on pre-order or back in stock later, or an item that ships from a different warehouse, we send the available items first rather than hold your whole order. Each package has its own tracking number and you are not charged extra for a split shipment. Tracking emails are sent for each package. If you would rather wait and receive everything together, contact us before your order ships and we will see what we can do.&nbsp;</p>",
            "section_id": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_item_UmwFTW": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "secure_strap": false,
            "heading": "When will my pre-order or backordered item ship?",
            "text": "<p>The expected ship date is shown on the product page when you order. Your card is charged at purchase. We email you a tracking number when your item ships. If the date changes, we will email you.</p>",
            "section_id": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_item_JJCJwr": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "secure_strap": false,
            "heading": "I'm having problems tracking my order.",
            "text": "<p>Sorry about that! Please note the carrier could take 1-2 business days to register your shipment status online. </p><p>If your tracking number isn't updating or working at all after this time period, please reach out to us via <a href=\"https://qureskincare.customerdesk.io/#rp-customer-widget-home\" title=\"https://qureskincare.customerdesk.io/#rp-customer-widget-home\">Customer Portal.</a> We can give you the inside info.</p>",
            "section_id": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_item_tgNbME": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "secure_strap": false,
            "heading": "Do I need to pay for Taxes and Duties?",
            "text": "<p>Orders shipped outside the US may be charged local taxes, VAT or import duties when they reach your country. These are set by your local customs office, not by Qure. The carrier will ask you to pay them before delivery. For UK orders, VAT is collected at checkout. We are legally required to declare the full value of the shipment and will provide an invoice to customs should they require it.</p><p>Please do not refuse the parcel. If you refuse delivery or the charges go unpaid, the parcel is returned to us. Unpaid duties and a $10 restocking fee are then deducted from your refund. If you have questions about a charge, contact your local customs office first.</p>",
            "section_id": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_item_4EgMGi": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "secure_strap": false,
            "heading": "My order was lost, damaged, or missing something!",
            "text": "<p>If your tracking says delivered but you cannot find the parcel, check with others in your household and your neighbors, look in safe places and check any doorbell camera. If you still cannot find it, or if the parcel arrived damaged or with items missing or wrong, <a href=\"https://qureskincare.customerdesk.io/#rp-customer-widget-home\" title=\"https://qureskincare.customerdesk.io/#rp-customer-widget-home\">please contact us </a>within 15 days of the delivery date.&nbsp;</p><p>Provide your order number and details of the missing items, and we will assist you in resolving the issue as quickly as possible. Please prepare a photo of all items received, the packing slip, barcode, and the shipping label affixed to the box. Keep all packaging until we have resolved your case.</p>",
            "section_id": "Orders"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_kHLgRg": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "secure_strap": false,
            "heading": "Where is my order?",
            "text": "<p>Use the tracking link in your shipping confirmation email, or enter your order number on our <a href=\"https://qureskincareaftership.aftership.com\" title=\"https://qureskincareaftership.aftership.com\">Order Tracking page. </a>Carriers can take 1 to 2 business days to show the first scan. Tracking can also pause for several days while a parcel moves between countries or between carriers.</p><p><a href=\"https://qureskincare.customerdesk.io/#rp-customer-widget-home\" title=\"https://qureskincare.customerdesk.io/#rp-customer-widget-home\">Contact us</a> if tracking shows no movement for 5 business days, or if it says delivered and you cannot find the parcel. Have your order number ready.</p>",
            "section_id": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_item_ErhU7D": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "secure_strap": false,
            "heading": "How can I update my order or cancel my order?",
            "text": "<p>Within 30 minutes of ordering, you can update your delivery address, email address and order notes yourself using the link in your confirmation email.</p><p>After 30 minutes, <a href=\"https://qureskincare.customerdesk.io/#rp-customer-widget-home\" title=\"https://qureskincare.customerdesk.io/#rp-customer-widget-home\">contact us</a> as soon as possible. If your order has not been dispatched, we can usually help with changes. We cannot move an order to an address in a different country.</p><p>Orders go to our warehouse automatically and we cannot always stop them. Once an order has shipped it cannot be cancelled or changed. You can return it after it arrives under our 30-day money-back guarantee (see Returns & Exchanges).</p>",
            "section_id": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_item_xczpmx": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "secure_strap": false,
            "heading": "My promo code isn't working.",
            "text": "<p>If your promo code won't apply or you get an error message, check whether the following applies to you:</p><ul><li>You haven't entered the code exactly as it was advertised - Try copying and pasting it and don't leave any extra characters or spaces.</li><li>The code is expired - Check the end date in the email, text or post where you found it. We cannot apply expired codes after the order is placed.</li><li>The code is being used on an already discounted bundle.</li><li>The code is only valid for a particular product - Double check that you're purchasing the right product for the code you want to use.</li><li>You didn't obtain your coupon from a valid source - These are: our website banner, social media post, or email promotions - be sure to subscribe to our newsletter.</li><li>You signed up for a code but did not receive it: check your spam and promotions folders, then contact us and we will resend it.</li></ul><p>If you are still experiencing problems after checking all the points above, please contact us via the <a href=\"https://qureskincare.customerdesk.io/#rp-customer-widget-home\" title=\"https://qureskincare.customerdesk.io/#rp-customer-widget-home\">Help Center</a>. Include the details of the coupon code you're trying to use and the items you have in your cart - we'll be happy to help!</p>",
            "section_id": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_item_9enLGF": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "secure_strap": false,
            "heading": "Can I use multiple promo codes at checkout?",
            "text": "<p>You can use one promo code per order. If you've encountered two valid Qure promo codes then please choose the one you want to use more.</p>",
            "section_id": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_item_RdfVdp": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "secure_strap": false,
            "heading": "I bought from Amazon, TikTok Shop or another reseller. Who do I contact?",
            "text": "<p>Orders placed on another store are handled by that store. Warranty and returns on this page apply to products bought directly from qureskincare.com.</p>",
            "section_id": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_item_LKbEHD": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "secure_strap": false,
            "heading": "How do I contact Qure, and how long will you take to reply?",
            "text": "<p>Use the <a href=\"https://qureskincare.customerdesk.io/#rp-customer-widget-home\" title=\"https://qureskincare.customerdesk.io/#rp-customer-widget-home\">Help Center</a> (chat and email), WhatsApp (+1 240 896 3833), or book a free call with our team. &nbsp;Our team are always on hand to help and you can expect a response within 24hrs. During Busier times or holiday season it may take up to 48hrs for a response. Please include your order number so we can help faster.</p>",
            "section_id": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_item_yhbpCU": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "secure_strap": false,
            "heading": "What is SecureShip?",
            "text": "<p>SecureShip is optional shipping protection you can add at checkout. It covers parcels that are lost, damaged in transit, or reported delivered but stolen. If you have SecureShip and your parcel is lost or damaged, <a href=\"https://qureskincare.customerdesk.io/#rp-customer-widget-home\" title=\"https://qureskincare.customerdesk.io/#rp-customer-widget-home\">contact us</a> within 15 days of delivery, keep all packaging, and send photos. We will arrange a replacement or refund. If you did not add SecureShip, contact us anyway and we will look into your case with the carrier.</p><p>How to make a claim:</p><p>All packaging material and damaged goods must be kept in the original form as received. Packaging and damaged goods should not be disposed of or released to the carrier before a claim is completed as photographs will be required. Failure to comply will result in the denial of the claim due to insufficient packaging.</p><p>Concealed damage allows for the discovery of loss or damage up to 15 days after final delivery. The loss is deemed to have possibly occurred during the insured transit. Discovery of loss or damage occurring 16 days or later after final delivery is deemed to have occurred while the shipment was NOT in transit, and therefore, is not covered.</p><p>In case of loss or damage to the covered parcel or freight the following must be completed:</p><ul><li>The Insured will file immediate notice of non-delivery, damage, or shortage with the Qure Customer Service Team. The Insured will not file a claim with the Carrier as all rights to the carrier provided coverage is assigned to Qure Customer Service Team.</li></ul><p>Once a claim has been accepted and approved by us, prompt payment will be made to the Insured. SecureShip will rely on the determination of responsibility made by the original Carrier to assist in substantiating the loss.</p><p>All fees paid for the Services are non-refundable and non-transferable except as may be expressly provided in these Terms.</p>",
            "section_id": ""
          }
        }
      },
