    "n_faq_content_BEUB9R": {
      "type": "n_faq-content",
      "blocks": {
        "faq_item_aTR4Yi": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "secure_strap": false,
            "heading": "What is the Q-Rejuvalight Pro Facewear?",
            "text": "<p>Q-Rejuvalight Pro Facewear is a non-invasive LED face mask that brings clinically studied light wavelengths into an easy at-home treatment. It is FDA-cleared for the treatment of wrinkles and mild to moderate inflammatory acne, helping improve the look of fine lines, firmness, skin tone and texture over time.</p><p>It comes with a compatible iOS/Android app that allows you to personalize, schedule and track your treatments.</p><p>Q-Rejuvalight Pro Facewear is a face mask that puts clinical-grade LED therapy in your hands so you can operate easily, all by yourself, in the comfort of your own home!</p><p>It comes with a compatible iOS/Android app that allows you to fully customize, track and plan your treatments.</p>",
            "section_id": "Technology"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_a4miCD": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "secure_strap": false,
            "heading": "How does Qure's Light Therapy technology work?",
            "text": "<p>Q-Rejuvalight Pro Facewear uses clinically studied wavelengths of LED light delivered directly to the skin. In Skin Rejuvenating Mode, multiple wavelengths help reduce the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles while improving the look of firmness, elasticity, uneven texture and radiance.&nbsp;</p><p>Skin Clearing Mode uses targeted wavelengths to help treat mild to moderate inflammatory acne, reduce breakouts and support clearer-looking skin over time.</p><p>Q-Rejuvalight Pro Facewear uses clinical-grade technology to deliver concentrated wavelengths of light to your skin. The wavelengths are absorbed by your skin cells. Used consistently, this can help skin look smoother, firmer and more even over time.</p>",
            "section_id": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_item_Pj7A8R": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "secure_strap": false,
            "heading": "How many LEDs does the Q-Rejuvalight Pro have and what wavelengths?",
            "text": "<p>The Q-Rejuvalight Pro features 160 dual-core LEDs and uses 5 clinically studied light wavelengths across its Skin Rejuvenating and Skin Clearing treatments:</p><ul><li>Infrared light (880 nm): Used in the Skin Rejuvenating treatment as part of a multi-wavelength approach designed to help improve the appearance of fine lines, firmness, elasticity and skin texture.</li><li>Deep Red (660 nm): Used in the Skin Rejuvenating treatment to support smoother-looking skin and a more radiant-looking complexion.</li><li>Red (630 nm): Used across both Skin Rejuvenating and Skin Clearing treatments to support smoother, clearer-looking skin and improve overall skin appearance over time.</li><li>Amber (605 nm): Used in the Skin Rejuvenating treatment to help improve the look of uneven skin tone and texture and support a more radiant-looking complexion.</li><li>Blue (415 nm): Used in the Skin Clearing treatment to help treat mild to moderate inflammatory acne, reduce breakouts and support clearer-looking skin over time.</li></ul><p>There are three treatment modes: the Skin Rejuvenating Treatment; the Skin Clearing Treatment; and custom zone selection on five facial areas via the Qure app.</p>",
            "section_id": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_item_g4mtBM": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "secure_strap": false,
            "heading": "Does the Q-Rejuvalight Pro Facewear use infrared light as well?",
            "text": "<p>Yes! The Q-Rejuvalight Pro Facewear uses red, infrared, amber, and deep red lights for the Skin Rejuvenating treatment.</p>",
            "section_id": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_item_PienAH": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "secure_strap": false,
            "heading": "What does the Skin Rejuvenating mode treat?",
            "text": "<p>The Skin Rejuvenating Treatment is FDA-cleared for the treatment of wrinkles and combines red, deep red, infrared and amber wavelengths to target visible signs of skin aging, which is also why the LED lights appear orange. With consistent use, it helps reduce the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles, improve the look of firmness and elasticity, smooth uneven-looking texture and promote a more radiant-looking complexion.</p>",
            "section_id": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_item_AXrMDh": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "secure_strap": false,
            "heading": "What does the Skin Clearing mode treat?",
            "text": "<p>The Skin Clearing Treatment combines red and blue wavelengths and is FDA-cleared for the treatment of mild to moderate inflammatory acne. With consistent use, it helps reduce breakouts, improve the appearance of acne-prone skin and redness associated with acne, and support clearer-looking skin over time.</p>",
            "section_id": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_item_wjtMGF": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "secure_strap": false,
            "heading": "Can I customize my Q-Rejuvalight Pro Facewear treatment routine?",
            "text": "<p>Yes! While each Q-Rejuvalight Pro Facewear comes with a recommended pre-programmed treatment routine, you can personalize your treatments and experience by creating your own treatment routine via the Qure Skincare app.&nbsp;</p><p>You can choose your preferred treatment mode (Skin Rejuvenating or Skin Clearing) on 5 different facial areas.</p>",
            "section_id": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_item_GN3gtL": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "secure_strap": false,
            "heading": "Is the Q-Rejuvalight Pro Facewear safe to use?",
            "text": "<p>Yes. Q-Rejuvalight Pro is an FDA-cleared, non-invasive LED light therapy device designed for at-home use. It requires no downtime and involves no needles or surgery. It is suitable for Fitzpatrick skin types I–IV when used as directed. If you have Fitzpatrick skin type V or VI, check with your doctor or healthcare professional before use.</p><p>Before your first full treatment, you must complete the light sensitivity test outlined in the user guide. After testing, wait 24 hours. If you experience pain, discomfort or redness lasting more than two hours, consult your doctor before continuing. Always use the supplied protective eyewear and follow the user guide.</p><p>It is not suitable for everyone: see \"Who should not use the Q-Rejuvalight Pro?\" below.</p>",
            "section_id": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_item_6U4DBj": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "secure_strap": false,
            "heading": "Who should not use the Q-Rejuvalight Pro?",
            "text": "<p>Q-Rejuvalight Pro is intended for adults only. Do not use the device if you are photosensitive or taking medication that increases sensitivity to light unless your healthcare professional has confirmed it is suitable for you.</p><p>Consult your doctor before use if you are pregnant, breastfeeding or planning to become pregnant, or if you have a history of seizures triggered by light. If you have severe acne or painful, raised, crusting or bleeding skin, consult a healthcare professional before treatment. Do not use the device if you have had a sunburn within the past two weeks.</p>",
            "section_id": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_item_pEnpkb": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "secure_strap": false,
            "heading": "Should I protect and close my eyes during treatment?",
            "text": "<p>The Q-Rejuvalight Pro has been tested and cleared for eye safety. It has successfully passed the IEC62471 evaluation for eye safety test, which is used to determine whether a device's light output is safe for the eyes or not. Regardless, we recommend closing your eyes and wearing protective eyewear during treatment. The light can be bright when powered on and some users may experience sensitivity, even when closing their eyes.</p><p>As part of our commitment to your safety we decided to take the initiative to include certified light blocking protective eyewear with our Q-Rejuvalight Pro LED mask.</p>",
            "section_id": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_item_agNxHf": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "secure_strap": false,
            "heading": "Does my Q-Rejuvalight Pro Facewear work without the app?",
            "text": "<p>You can manually use your Q-Rejuvalight Pro Facewear without using the app. However if you're wanting to customize your treatment on different areas on your face, then this will need to be done via the Qure Skincare app.</p><p>To choose/change a full treatment without using the app, follow the instructions below:</p><ul><li>Power on the device by holding the Q button on forehead until the led indicator light is on</li><li>Press the button once for Skin Rejuvenating mode</li><li>Press it again for Skin Clearing mode</li><li>Switch off the device by holding down the Q button until the indicator light turns off</li></ul>",
            "section_id": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_item_B4BF94": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "secure_strap": false,
            "heading": "Where can I fit in the Q-Rejuvalight Pro Facewear in my daily skin care routine?",
            "text": "<p>You may easily fit in a 3-minute treatment right after you wash and dry your face. The only important thing to remember is that your face should be clean before the treatment. Once the treatment is done, you may proceed in applying serums and creams to your skin as desired!</p>",
            "section_id": "Results"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_rchTtz": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "secure_strap": false,
            "heading": "How often can I use my Q-Rejuvalight Pro Facewear?",
            "text": "<p>You only need one 3-minute treatment per day. For best results, we recommend that you do your 3 minute treatment daily. You may also do one full Skin Rejuvenating treatment and one full Skin Clearing treatment per day.</p>",
            "section_id": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_item_6eXwmb": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "secure_strap": false,
            "heading": "How long will it take before I start seeing results?",
            "text": "<p>Results depend on your skin and your concern. With daily use, many users notice clearer-looking skin within 2 weeks. Smoother-looking skin, softer-looking fine lines and a more even tone usually take 8 to 12 weeks. Individual results vary. We recommend using the mask consistently for at least 3 months before judging results.</p>",
            "section_id": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_item_UQdzLj": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "secure_strap": false,
            "heading": "Can I use the Q-Rejuvalight Pro Facewear with retinol and microneedling routine?",
            "text": "<p>Yes. Use the Q-Rejuvalight Pro on clean skin before applying retinol. After your LED treatment, follow with your usual retinol serum, such as Qure’s All-In-One Face Serum, as directed.</p><p>If you’re performing a Micro-Infusion treatment, you can use the Q-Rejuvalight Pro before your treatment and again the following morning, provided your skin feels comfortable. The morning-after LED session can be used as part of your post-treatment routine to support a calmer-looking complexion.</p><p>Many people use light therapy alongside retinol. If you use Micro-Infusion or another needling treatment, wait until any redness has settled before using the mask, and follow the post-treatment care steps in the Micro-Infusion guide. If your skin feels irritated, pause use and contact us.</p>",
            "section_id": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_item_fKVwF6": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "secure_strap": false,
            "heading": "How do I start my first treatment?",
            "text": "<p>Activate your Q-Rejuvalight Pro Facewear via the Qure Skincare app, or follow the How To Use guide, which can be found inside the box.</p><p>After cleansing your face, place our Q-Rejuvalight Pro Facewear comfortably over the face, securing strap around head. Press and hold the Q power button on forehead for 3 seconds to turn on our Q-Rejuvalight Pro Facewear, select treatment mode on the app (Skin Rejuvenating or Skin Clearing) and start your treatment!</p>",
            "section_id": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_item_xVbCJY": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "secure_strap": false,
            "heading": "How do I charge my Q-Rejuvalight Pro Facewear?",
            "text": "<p>The Q-Rejuvalight Pro is USB-rechargeable. A two and a half hour charge can deliver up to 10 treatments. Plug into a USB power adapter. Input should be 5V/1A and the voltage should be no more than 5V.</p><p>Plug the USB-C power/charging cord into the port connector of your Q-Rejuvalight Pro Facewear, then plug it into a universal USB power adapter. Device is fully charged when the red power indicator light next to the charging port is turned off.</p>",
            "section_id": "Charging Q-Rejuvalight Pro"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_jwxEAE": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "secure_strap": false,
            "heading": "Can the Q Rejuvalight Pro Facewear be used while charging?",
            "text": "<p>No, you cannot turn on the device while charging for safety reasons.</p>",
            "section_id": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_item_HJ84eW": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "secure_strap": false,
            "heading": "What does it mean when my Q-Rejuvalight Pro is continuously blinking?",
            "text": "<p><strong>Charging</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Indicator light is slowly blinking while plugged in:</strong> The mask is charging. Leave it plugged in. A 2.5-hour charge gives up to 10 treatments.</li><li><strong>Indicator light turns off while plugged in:</strong> The mask is fully charged. Unplug it and it’s ready to use.</li><li><strong>Indicator light is rapidly blinking:</strong> The battery is low. Charge the mask.</li></ul><p><strong>Turning the mask on</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Indicator light on after you press and hold the Q button on the forehead:</strong> The mask is powered on. Press the button once for Skin Rejuvenating mode or twice for Skin Clearing mode, or choose a mode in the app.</li><li><strong>No light when you press the Q button while plugged in:</strong> The mask can’t be turned on while charging. Unplug it, then hold the Q button for 3 seconds.</li><li><strong>No light when you press and hold the Q button and it is not plugged in:</strong> The battery may be flat, or there may be a charging problem. Charge fully with the USB-C cable and a 5V adapter, and try a different cable or outlet. If it still doesn’t turn on, contact us through the <a href=\"https://qureskincare.customerdesk.io/#rp-customer-widget-home\" title=\"https://qureskincare.customerdesk.io/#rp-customer-widget-home\">Help Center.</a></li></ul><p><br/><strong>During treatment</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Lights go off before 3 minutes:</strong> The battery is low, or the mask is too warm. Let it cool for a few minutes and charge it fully. If it keeps switching off early, contact us.</li><li><strong>Lights go off at 3 minutes:</strong> The treatment has finished. Nothing is needed, as the mask shuts off automatically.</li></ul>",
            "section_id": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_item_3y4nPr": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "secure_strap": false,
            "heading": "What's included in the box?",
            "text": "<p>Inside the box, you'll find:</p><ul><li>Q-Rejuvalight Pro LED Face Mask</li><li>Adjustable head strap for a secure, comfortable fit</li><li>Protective eyewear</li><li>USB-C charging cable</li><li>Portable luxury storage pouch</li><li>Clear setup instructions and user manual</li></ul>",
            "section_id": "Storing Q-Rejuvalight Pro"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_cQM6Bi": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "secure_strap": false,
            "heading": "How do I properly store my Q-Rejuvalight Pro Facewear?",
            "text": "<p>We recommend to keep your Q-Rejuvalight Pro Facewear in a dry environment and always keeping your Q-Rejuvalight Pro in the storage bag when not using it.&nbsp;</p><p>Usually, the bathroom is not the best place for keeping your Qure device due to the heightened moisture in a bathroom.</p>",
            "section_id": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_item_N3q6zf": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "secure_strap": false,
            "heading": "What is the best way to clean the Q-Rejuvalight Pro after use?",
            "text": "<p>Wipe the inside with a damp cloth to remove any residue from skin oils after each use. Make sure the Q-Rejuvalight Pro Facewear is unplugged and turned off. Then use a damp, soft, or microfiber cloth to clean the facial area. Repeat until the Q-Rejuvalight Pro Facewear is clean and then dry with a clean dry cloth.</p>",
            "section_id": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_item_7wwtna": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "secure_strap": false,
            "heading": "How do I prevent the inner mask silicone from discoloration?",
            "text": "<p>Make sure to clean your face thoroughly before use! Residue from make ups or other creams/serums can cause discoloration.</p>",
            "section_id": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_item_dL9jdc": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "secure_strap": true,
            "heading": "How do I secure the strap to my Q-Rejuvalight Pro?",
            "text": "",
            "section_id": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_item_qKKEke": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "secure_strap": false,
            "heading": "Is the Q-Rejuvalight Pro Facewear BPA free?",
            "text": "<p>Yes. The Q-Rejuvalight Pro Facewear is BPA free.</p>",
            "section_id": "Safety"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_dJxNtJ": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "secure_strap": false,
            "heading": "Is it safe to use LED light therapy while pregnant or breastfeeding?",
            "text": "<p>For those pregnant or breastfeeding, we recommend checking with your doctor before starting Red Light therapy treatments.</p>",
            "section_id": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_item_eez4Xg": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "secure_strap": false,
            "heading": "Does the Q-Rejuvalight Pro Facewear come with a warranty?",
            "text": "<p>Q-Rejuvalight Pro Facewear comes with one (1) year warranty covering any manufacturer related problems resulting from everyday use of the product. For more information on warranty, please visit our Warranty section below.</p>",
            "section_id": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_item_GdiJfU": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "secure_strap": false,
            "heading": "Is the Q-Rejuvalight Pro FDA-cleared?",
            "text": "<p>Yes. The Q-Rejuvalight Pro is an FDA-cleared, at-home LED light therapy device for the treatment of wrinkles and mild to moderate inflammatory acne. It uses clinically studied light wavelengths and is designed for regular at-home use.</p>",
            "section_id": ""
          }
        }
      },
