        "heading": "<h2>Micro-Infusion System</h2>",
        "section_id": "Micro-Infusion System"
      }
    },
    "n_faq_content_eLwabw": {
      "type": "n_faq-content",
      "blocks": {
        "faq_item_mp6NG9": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "secure_strap": false,
            "heading": "What is the Q-Renew LLLT Helmet?",
            "text": "<p>The Q-Renew LLLT Helmet is an FDA-cleared light therapy device designed to support healthier looking hair by delivering low-level red light and laser energy directly to the scalp.&nbsp;</p><p>It uses 220 LED diodes and 150, low-level laser diodes with clinically studied wavelengths, designed to promote hair growth and support fuller-looking hair over time.</p>",
            "section_id": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_item_t3NcGF": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "secure_strap": false,
            "heading": "How does the technology work?",
            "text": "<p>The Q-Renew LLLT Helmet delivers targeted red LED wavelengths and low-level laser energy directly to the scalp. This light therapy supports hair follicles, encourages the active growth phase, helps support follicle activity and supports circulation around the follicles. With consistent use, the Q-Renew LLLT Helmet has been clinically evaluated to improve hair fullness, thickness and overall hair quality in 16 weeks.</p>",
            "section_id": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_item_EAFyJB": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "secure_strap": false,
            "heading": "How many LEDs does the Q-Renew LLLT Helmet have and what wavelengths?",
            "text": "<p>The Q-Renew LLLT Helmet contains 220 LED diodes that operate at 630 nm, 660 nm, and 680 nm, along with 150 medical-grade, low-level laser diodes that emit light at 655 nm, providing a total of 370 targeted light sources for comprehensive scalp coverage.</p>",
            "section_id": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_item_LjtEUT": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "secure_strap": false,
            "heading": "Can I customize my treatment?",
            "text": "<p>On the LCD screen you're able to select your desired treatment zone before starting the session. This means you aren't locked into a single full-head mode. You can choose where you want the light therapy to focus.</p>",
            "section_id": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_item_AmWhYd": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "secure_strap": false,
            "heading": "Where should I fit in the Q-Renew LLLT Helmet in my haircare routine?",
            "text": "<p>Use the Q-Renew LLLT Helmet on clean, dry, product-free hair before applying any styling products, oils, serums, or treatments. We recommend using the helmet 5-7 times per week for at least 16 weeks. After that, continue every other day to maintain results. Each treatment lasts 12 minutes and ends automatically.</p>",
            "section_id": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_item_cHY4bn": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "secure_strap": false,
            "heading": "How often can I use my Q-Renew LLLT Helmet?",
            "text": "<p>We recommend using the helmet 5-7 times per week.</p>",
            "section_id": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_item_zNGrCK": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "secure_strap": false,
            "heading": "How long will it take before I start seeing results?",
            "text": "<p>Hair growth takes time and consistent use. Visible improvements were observed after 16 weeks in Q-Renew’s study, with results becoming more noticeable with continued treatment.</p><p>After 16 weeks, clinical measurements showed increases of up to 27% in hair growth rate, up to 12% in average hair thickness and up to 19% in total hair width per cm². Individual results may vary.</p>",
            "section_id": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_item_AGVVrM": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "secure_strap": false,
            "heading": "How do I charge my Q-Renew LLLT Helmet?",
            "text": "<p>To charge your Q-Renew LLLT Helmet, connect the provided USB-C cable to the charging port on the back of the charging base, or connect the cable directly to the helmet’s charging port. Plug the other end into a power supply using a 5V DC adapter. Only use the provided USB-C cable and a 5V DC adapter for charging.</p><p>When the device is charging, the LCD screen will display the charging status. If the screen is inactive, tap it to check the progress. A full charge takes approximately 4 hours.</p>",
            "section_id": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_item_aFhwqP": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "secure_strap": false,
            "heading": "How do I properly store my Q-Renew LLLT Helmet?",
            "text": "<p>The best way to store your Q-Renew LLLT Helmet is in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight. We recommend storing your helmet on the charging base to keep it ready for your next treatment, or in the provided box.</p>",
            "section_id": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_item_dMeKDV": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "secure_strap": false,
            "heading": "What is the best way to clean the Q-Renew LLLT Helmet?",
            "text": "<p>The device can be cleaned with a water-based wipe or a damp, clean cloth. For stubborn stains, we recommend gently wiping with 70% alcohol. Avoid using harsh abrasive cleaners, solvents, or other chemical products as this may harm the device.</p><p><strong>Optional:</strong> For an enhanced cleaning experience, lightly spray the inside of the helmet with the <a href=\"#\">Qure Dermal Mist</a> and gently wipe to help maintain hygiene and freshness.&nbsp;</p>",
            "section_id": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_item_HRgQME": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "secure_strap": false,
            "heading": "Who is the Q-Renew LLLT Helmet not suitable for?",
            "text": "<p>Do not use this product if you are under 18, pregnant, breastfeeding, photosensitive, on light-sensitizing medications, prone to light-triggered headaches or seizures, or have open wounds or infections on the scalp.<br/><br/>Not sure if it is right for you? Book a free consultation with our team.</p>",
            "section_id": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_item_e6KPtw": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "secure_strap": false,
            "heading": "Does the Q-Renew LLLT Helmet come with a warranty?",
            "text": "<p>We provide a 3-year limited warranty covering defects in materials and workmanship for the Q-Renew LLLT Helmet when purchased directly from Qure Skincare.</p><p>For more information on warranty, please visit <a href=\"#\">Our Warranty Policy</a>.</p>",
            "section_id": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_item_QCdqtq": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "secure_strap": false,
            "heading": "Is it FDA-cleared?",
            "text": "<p>Yes, the Q-Renew LLLT Helmet is FDA-cleared. </p><p>The Q-Renew LLLT Helmet is indicated for the promotion of hair growth in males who have Norwood-Hamilton classifications of IIa-V, and in females with androgenetic alopecia who have Ludwig-Savin Classifications of I-II, and in both, Fitzpatrick Classification of Skin Phototypes I to IV.</p>",
            "section_id": ""
          }
        }
      },
